  "body": "## What's changed\n\n**Fix: the details pane dropped most of what it read.** Codec, uncompressed size, row groups and hive partition layout were read from the Parquet footer, written to the cache, and then discarded on the way to the screen — so a partitioned dataset showed no partitions and a compressed one no codec. Only network roots, which take a different path, were unaffected.\n\n- Home screen demo, and a note on how it is recorded. ([docs](https://derekwisong.github.io/datui/latest/demos.html))\n- `modified now ago` now reads `modified now`.\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/derekwisong/datui/compare/v0.3.0...v0.3.1",
